<div class="hero">
  <h1>Cherry Financing Purchase — Staff Training</h1>
  <p>How a financed hearing aid order moves from the Cherry link to the customer's door, and what each role does at every step.</p>
</div>

<h2>Who Does What</h2>
<div class="legend">
  <span class="pill p-auto">AUTOMATED</span> GHL does this by itself
</div>
<div class="legend">
  <span class="pill p-oc">MANUAL — ORDER COORDINATOR</span> Cherry portal, Signia ordering, PirateShip labels, delivery tracking
</div>
<div class="legend">
  <span class="pill p-hp">MANUAL — HEARING PROFESSIONAL</span> Receiving, programming, and UPS drop-off
</div>
<div class="note"><strong>The golden rule:</strong> when you finish your step, <strong>move the card</strong> to the next stage in the <em>HBS — Cherry Financing Purchase</em> pipeline. Moving the card is what creates the next person's task. If a card isn't moved, the next person never gets notified.</div>

